+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+This project has no current recorded decision governing TLS certificate verification behavior in development builds. An earlier configuration record on this subject existed but was removed from the tree, and no replacement policy value has been recorded since; until a decision is recorded, no dev-build exception to certificate verification should be assumed.
